{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24904","headline":"御题国子监门 · 薛存诚","name":"御题国子监门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宸翰符玄造，荣题国子门。\n笔锋回日月，字势动乾坤。\n檐下云光绝，梁间鹊影飜。\n张英圣莫拟，索靖妙难言。\n爲着盘龙迹，能彰舞凤蹲。\n更随垂露像，常以沐皇恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛存诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}